{{also|Sinus|sinüs}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|la|sinus|notext=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈsaɪnəs/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|aɪnəs|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|es}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} A pouch or cavity in any organ or tissue, especially the [[paranasal sinus]].
# {{lb|en|botany}} A notch or depression between two lobes or teeth in the margin of an organ.
# {{lb|en|pathology}} An abnormal cavity or passage such as a [[fistula]], caused by the destruction of tissue.
# A [[bay]] of the [[sea]]; a [[recess]] in the [[shore]].

